# Build context of the prototype's image (prototype/Dockerfile): only the
# files that it copies; everything else, secrets included, stays out.
*
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!LICENSES/
!schemas/
!src/
!examples/demo/
!prototype/

# Never, even inside the directories above
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
examples/demo/data/
